    "requires": [
      "Caller-supplied persistent scratch directory and uv-created virtual environment.",
      "Caller-supplied Git checkout, firmware assets matching provenance.json and two WASM artifacts matching the recorded hashes.",
      "The Git checkout must provide the recorded web/wasm runtime modules. Copies are retained under harness/runtime for hash comparison.",
      "Chrome installed for Chrome capture; ordinary visible Safari page for Safari capture. No Remote Automation setting change is required."
    ],
    "sourceMeaning": "Chrome starts a fresh headless process/profile for each arm. Safari reloads the visible page and starts a fresh worker; process and caches may persist. Source siblings not used by the timing path are retained only because they were included in its provenance hash map."
